      "That is six to twenty-four thousand dollars in SEO fees spent on remediation work before any actual ranking strategy begins. If the website development company had integrated SEO from the start, that remediation cost would be zero. The SEO budget could go entirely toward content strategy, link building, and competitive positioning from month one. Over a twelve-month period, the difference in results between an SEO-integrated build and a retrofit approach is typically thirty to fifty percent more organic traffic, because the integrated approach gets a three-month head start on actual optimization.",
      "## How to Choose a Website Development Company That Understands SEO",
