      "A website development company that takes SEO seriously will have clear answers to all of these questions. They will talk about search visibility as a development requirement, not an optional add-on. They will show you sites they have built that rank well, not just sites that look good in screenshots. And they will include SEO deliverables in their project scope, not suggest you hire a separate agency after launch.",
      "At VELIQ, we are a website development company that integrates SEO into every project by default. Our development process includes keyword research during discovery, SEO-informed information architecture, technical SEO implementation during development, and post-launch monitoring to track ranking progress. We believe that building a website without SEO is like opening a store without putting up a sign. The product might be excellent, but nobody will find it.",
